OL,3,GNEWSAWho is London's mystery Batman
OL,4,Adoing good deeds?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mysterious masked figure has been
OL,7,Fpopping up across London carrying out
OL,8,Frandom acts of kindness, from paying
OL,9,Ffor people's fuel to filling potholes
OL,10,Fand even selling Freddos for their
OL,11,Flong-lost price of 5p.
OL,13,FKnown only as "London's Batman", the
OL,14,Fcaped crusader has built up a large
OL,15,Fonline following by turning up across
OL,16,Fthe capital and offering help to
OL,17,Fstrangers.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
