OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWho is London's mystery Batman
OL,4,Adoing good deeds?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter weeks of speculation, BBC London
OL,7,Fwas invited to meet London's Batman,
OL,8,Fwho insisted: "It's not about who I am
OL,9,Funderneath. It's what I do that defines
OL,10,Fme."
OL,12,FThe invitation contained only a time
OL,13,Fand location, leaving plenty of
OL,14,Funcertainty about what, or who, would
OL,15,Fappear.
